title: Left Faction Splits
new-page: true
subtitle: The Left faction's disagreements with party policy have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: left_dissent >= 60 and not left_leaders_resigned and z_left_split_timer = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_leaders_resigned = 1;
Q.z_left_split_timer = 4;

if (Q.left_strength < 10) {
    Q.workers_z -= 3;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 3;
    Q.workers_kpd += 3;
    Q.rb_strength -= 200;
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.04;
} else if (Q.left_strength < 25) {
    Q.workers_z -= 4;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 4;
    Q.workers_kpd += 4;
    Q.unemployed_kpd += 2;
    Q.rb_strength -= 300;
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.05;
} else if (Q.left_strength < 40) {
    Q.workers_z -= 5;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 5;
    Q.workers_kpd += 5;
    Q.unemployed_kpd += 3;
    Q.rb_strength -= 400;
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.06;
} else if (Q.left_strength < 60) {
    Q.workers_z -= 6;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 6;
    Q.workers_kpd += 6;
    Q.unemployed_kpd += 3;
    Q.rb_strength -= 500;
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.08;
} else {
    Q.workers_z -= 8;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 8;
    Q.workers_kpd += 8;
    Q.unemployed_kpd += 4;
    Q.rb_strength -= 600;
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.1;
}

Q.kpd_relation += 5;
Q.z_relation -= 10;
Q.spd_relation -= 5;

Q.left_strength = Q.left_strength / 2;

Q.n_advisors_start = Q.n_advisors;
if (Q.moenius_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.moenius_advisor = 0;
if (Q.schmitz_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.schmitz_advisor = 0;
if (Q.n_advisors < Q.n_advisors_start) Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
!}
max-visits: 1

= Left Faction members split

Our policy choices have greatly offended the Left faction, and many of their leaders have resigned to form a new <span style="color: #9B0000;">**Christian Socialist Workers' Party (CSAP)**</span>. They argue that the party has abandoned its commitment to the working class and Catholic social teaching. While they don't count a huge section of our membership, this split weakens our appeal to Catholic workers.

[? if anti_fascist_available: The <span style="color: #006400;">Anti-Fascist</span> faction is deeply concerned by this development, fearing it fragments the democratic opposition. ?]